      "updated": 1769427004652,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- whatever change you choose to make, \n  that change is made \n- e.g. :\n    ° whether you added :\n        - a config map, \n        - a secret \n      or \n        - persistent volume claim, \n      or \n        - you added a health check like :\n            ° a readiness probe, \n            ° a liveness probe, \n           or \n            ° a starter probe, \n      or \n        - all of them together, \n\n    ==> those are changes because you make \n        those changes against the Deployment\n\n    ==> so again, you add these things to the Deployment\n        not to the Pod",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- whatever change you choose to make, \n  that change is made \n- e.g. :\n    ° whether you added :\n        - a config map, \n        - a secret \n      or \n        - persistent volume claim, \n      or \n        - you added a health check like :\n            ° a readiness probe, \n            ° a liveness probe, \n           or \n            ° a starter probe, \n      or \n        - all of them together, \n\n    ==> those are changes because you make \n        those changes against the Deployment\n\n    ==> so again, you add these things to the Deployment\n        not to the Pod",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
