      "updated": 1769428283323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "-  what's going to happen is that :\n    ° if the new pod does not pass Readiness Probe, \n    ==> then it's not going to be added to the as \n        an Endpoint of the Service \n    ==> which means that the older pod will \n        still remain functional\n\n- we don't want to send traffic from the user to \n  a pod that is not yet ready because :\n    ° what if the pod is still initializing ?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-  what's going to happen is that :\n    ° if the new pod does not pass Readiness Probe, \n    ==> then it's not going to be added to the as \n        an Endpoint of the Service \n    ==> which means that the older pod will \n        still remain functional\n\n- we don't want to send traffic from the user to \n  a pod that is not yet ready because :\n    ° what if the pod is still initializing ?",
