      "updated": 1769431720580,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- looking at the application right here :\n    ° it's the same image that is being used, \n    ° except that this is a different deployment\n- so we are using 85f9 ...\n  that's the deployment revision that we are using\n  where there were no values for the environment \n  variables, MY_STRING and MY_PASSWORD, and no \n  content at id_rsa and id_rsa.pub",
